{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-18",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Preserve both standalone input rows, the rightward collinear a-then-b chain and its separate aligned resultant row. Modern additions, not source givens: arbitrary regularized coordinates and lengths, generous row spacing, 36 px ordinary Latin labels with explicitly mapped deterministic notation over-arrows instead of unsupported combining glyphs, a single semantic resultant arrow instead of the scanned outlined shaft, and small unlabelled visible ink endpoint markers explicitly authorized for this bounded modern candidate. Notation arrows are glyph geometry, not additional physical vectors or numerical givens. The source has no dot markers. No numerical ratio is printed.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8p/figures/fig-18.png",
      "sha256": "d93d3fef8cbcb120b0b5d9be02e11a92d686ff17f283ca65e165861c841af110"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "phy8-c1-s1-n5", "text": "沿着同一直线方向的几个矢量（共线矢量）相加，也是根据这个法则.\n指向同一方向或彼此相反的共线矢量的加法，如图 $18$ 和 $19$ 所示.\n从这两个图可以看出，平行（共线）矢量的相加，象代数量一样，如果一个方向取“$+$”号，而相反的方向取“$-$”号."},
      {"lesson": "phy8-c1-s1-n5", "text": "两个矢量相加的另一种方法是：相加的两个矢量这样放置：其中一个矢量的终点作为另一个矢量的起点.\n两个矢量的和是一个从第一个矢量起点指向第二个矢量终点的矢量（图 $16$）.\n如果需要相加的不是两个，而是更多的矢量，也是应用这种方法.\n\n所有相加的矢量这样放置：第一个矢量的终点作为第二个矢量的起点，第二个矢量的终点作为第三个矢量的起点，余此类推.\n所有矢量的和或合矢量，是从第一个矢量起点指向最后一个矢量终点的矢量（图 $17$）."}
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-two-input-rows",
        "description": "Top standalone a points right; next standalone b is longer, points right and starts farther right. Both retain vector-arrow labels. No numerical lengths, ticks or point markers.",
        "objects": ["input-a", "input-b", "input-a-text", "input-b-text"],
        "assertions": ["input-a-connects", "input-b-connects"]
